{"id":"vod_md_5054","vodId":"5054","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"食戟之灵 餐之皿","name_cn":"食戟之灵 餐之皿","date":"2017-01-01","year":"2017","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"24集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230916-1/2d57338afbdb5851dea06a219ef68fe1.jpg"},"summary":"在老家的餐饮店“幸平餐馆”一边帮忙下厨一边磨炼厨艺的幸平创真，前往超级精英料理学校“远月茶寮料理学园”入学。幸平创真在学园中与各式各样的料理人相遇并不断成长着，同时也开始摸索“只属于自己的料理”。幸平创真在真实餐厅学习的“在职料理课程”中进一步积累了经验，突破了以往的自己，习得了新的料理，成功完成了课程并且迎来了新的成长。实地研修结束后，幸平创真在不断练习厨艺中度过每一天，并终于在“赏红叶会”向学园的顶点远月十杰发起了挑战。创真和远月十杰盯上了远月例行的学园祭“月飨祭”，每年有50万客人造访的怪物活动，他们会发生什么事？另一方面，背后一些人在悄然实施着计划――？创真新的战斗拉开了序幕！","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-16 08:49:43","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/15xZkud9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/GC6kT4eR/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/BzQqqK6a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/x7KFq7zr/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/5I4zbRMx/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/MlSGhisl/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/My7Jj5zo/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/Ppr0iwMG/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/cHmfPXiO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/sAl4GY7S/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/hKTu98MO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/0MGAW6Po/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/86WkgDwq/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/6NfM5SOz/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230914/xEZlUxaH/index.